synopsis: "OpenSSL 4.1.0's generated sources, from zig-openssl"
description: """
zig-openssl's checked-in generated C sources and manifest for OpenSSL 4.1.0,
installed for libopenssl to build from. The manifest is plain text: it lists the
sources, compiler definitions and include directories, so no generator is
needed."""
